	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratulor tibi, quod salvus et incolumis domum ad <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuos redieris; doleo interim, quod lavare ita, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>institueras, non potueris, video tamen domini bonitatem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>saepe mederi intempestivis nostris con<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>siliis; dum nos antrorsum nitimur, ille vel per <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>morbos vel per alias rationes retrorsum retrahit, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>non ut perdat, sed ut servet.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid si hanc ipsam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ob causam nunc quoque te afflixit morbo, ne lavares, id <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>est, ne pergeres incolumitatem tuam affligere?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Cum autem audio te rediisse incolumem domum, ve<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tera a te requiro officia scribendi, maxime quid <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>fiat in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> cum concilio <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> et cum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>principe <placeName ref="l1098">Florentino</placeName>, et an sint <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicae</placeName> naves in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mari vel Adriatico vel Tyrrheno.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Imprimis autem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>audire et videre cupio, quid actum sit in syn<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>odo vestra praeterita; nam festinando in thermas <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>iubebas suspensum tenerem animum, dum redires.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Interea calamitate afflicti sumus hic grandinis; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>benignus enim pater ferulam iis admovet, qui <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>verbis parere nolunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Agri et vineta sub urbe <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>perierunt; quae supra urbem ad lacum sunt, adhuc incolu<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mia sunt per domini clementiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus servet nos porro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName>Ioannem Schle<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>herum</persName> monoculum, non malum alioqui hominem, nosti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Is <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ante sesquiannum cessit <placeName ref="l646">Clarona</placeName>, haesit apud nos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nunc, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quando <placeName>Fabarienses</placeName> thermas invisit et <persName>Vesenium</persName> usque <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>rediit, captus et <placeName ref="l2450">Sviciam</placeName> ductus est.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scripsit illuc magistratus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>noster; responsum accepit, <foreign xml:lang="de">es syend ettlich, die werdint <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>inn berächten.</foreign></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Missus est ergo protinus quaestor aerarius <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName>Sprossius</persName>, ut adsit misero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Abunde satis monitus est; sed <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>monentibus non paruit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quaestor nondum rediit; nescimus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ergo, quid fiat aut factum sit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Plerique male ominantur; <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ego extrema expecto a [Quinque Pagis].</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">- Legatus regis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> scribit pios supplicationem et confessionem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName ref="p20341">regi Gallorum</persName> exhibuisse; principes ergo consiliarios <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>regis egisse per 8 aut 10 dies cum parlamento <placeName ref="l378">Parisiensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>de caussa religionis; se tamen nescire, quid decretum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>sit, scire autem, quod libere fuerint voces; in <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>aula <placeName ref="l1209">Navarrae</placeName> et <placeName ref="l3734">Condensis</placeName> libere <placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> et palam <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>praedicari evangelium; <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudum</placeName> coactum fuisse pacisci cum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/><placeName>Agroniis</placeName>, quibus manet religio integra.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">- Wie <persName ref="p8016">Thobias <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Egli</persName> zuͦ üch hinuff zogen, sol er zuͦ Wesen ettliche büchly <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ußteylt haben, deren halben ettliche schier umb <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ir läben kummen, und ist denen von <placeName ref="l2450">Schwytz</placeName> anzeigt, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8016">Egli</persName> sye dahinuff in <placeName ref="l648">Pündt</placeName> zogen, und ist zuͦ sorgen<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>, sy werdint ouch späch uff inn machen wie uff h. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><persName>Schlehern</persName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Dorumb warnend inn by zyt, so er her<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ab wölle, das er nieman darvon sage und ein an<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>dere straaß dann durch <placeName ref="l2450">Schwyzer</placeName> piet suͦchen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Die <placeName ref="l159">Frowenfäldisch</placeName> sach wurde imm darzuͦ schlahen; <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>do kan man nitt zuͦ wol sorg haben; <foreign xml:lang="la">nam homines <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>isti fremunt contra nos.</foreign></s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominus servet nos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 1<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>1. iulii 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Sa<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>luta d. <persName>Philippum</persName>, d. d. <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>consules et <persName ref="p6130">Pontasel<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>lam</persName> ac alios notos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Te salutant mei omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z14"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro, domi<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>no et fratri colendo et percharo suo.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
